-- ==========================================================================
-- Exercise catalog: one exact demo GIF per exercise, no GIF shared.
--
-- Audit (Oct 2026) found 45 GIFs shared by 194 exercises and 58 exercises
-- whose GIF showed a different movement. This migration:
--   * gives 77 exercises a new GIF that shows exactly them (74 from
--     ExerciseDB, 3 already in the bucket) plus matching instructions;
--   * renames 7 exercises to what their GIF actually shows;
--   * merges 80 exercises into the exercise they duplicate (pause/tempo
--     variants, repeated names, variants with no own GIF): every routine /
--     program row pointing at them is re-pointed first, then they are deleted.
--     Logged history keeps its own exercise_name snapshot, so past logs keep
--     the old name;
--   * clears the GIF and instructions of 15 exercises with no exact GIF
--     anywhere (better no demo than a wrong one);
--   * deletes the test entry "tu" if nothing references it.
--
-- BEFORE RUNNING: upload the new GIFs to the 'exercise-media' bucket. The
-- guard below aborts (and changes nothing) if any GIF or exercise is missing.
-- Apply in the Supabase SQL editor. One transaction: all or nothing.
-- ==========================================================================
begin;

